{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2013-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1377993600, "end_date": 1378598399, "month_true_total": 245, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:50:26 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "1292721", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990833154", "personaname": "PapaKicks", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/papakicks/", "num_games_owned": 705, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 103087, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 63816, "last_played": 1763075601, "avatar": "360236e555049f204b12d3a8685a3b9b9764ebfe"}, "language": "english", "review": "I had no idea I wanted to be a ninja cyborg warrior assassin sword weilding marksman... but I did. I really, REALLY, did.", "timestamp_created": 1378587124, "timestamp_updated": 1393394555, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4067008", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031553643", "personaname": "Max Noskill", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MaxNoskill/", "num_games_owned": 917, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 169892, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15753, "last_played": 1553383235, "avatar": "835144c83fea4c05e9c107733acd24d3fe63f43a"}, "language": "english", "review": "8/10, very good game\n\nKeywords: Space ninjas, free to play, player versus enemy.\n\nYou don your armor (warframe), grab a weapon, assemble squad of ninjas and go kill lots of enemies on secret ninja missions. Gameplay is fast and usually very relaxed, although high-level missions exists to keep you challenged.\n\nCompleting missions and killing enemies will occasionally drop 'module' collecting cards, which you can use to improve your weapons, also with collected resources and blueprints you can craft new weapons.\n\nThere is occasional community events - alerts - to give out special rewards.\n\nYou need teammates to get anything out of this. There is Solo mode but lone gameplay is not very fun, unless you grind for particular item.\n\nUnlike most of f2p-games this is still __designed for humans to play__. Grinding to expand your new arsenal is VERY possible instead of buying. I recommend buying warframe&weapon slots as these you can't grind.\n\nCurrently on Beta testing, Update 9.\n", "timestamp_created": 1378576583, "timestamp_updated": 1378576583, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540229856967926025", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1047689", "author": {"steamid": "76561197985259845", "personaname": "Mr Bob", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197985259845/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 0, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "last_played": 0, "avatar": "241fe84a50d305806f76a5a66e1c550bcd2a4c4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "as ♥♥♥♥ as chewbaccas ass fur", "timestamp_created": 1378562763, "timestamp_updated": 1378562763, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502712488174438477", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6412616", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065746001", "personaname": "uselele", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/use1ess/", "